          0 : =81                USARTC:         equ     USART+1 Control register
          0 : =82                USARTRV:        equ     USART+2 Receive interrupt vector (NPSWx)
          0 : =83                USARTTV:        equ     USART+3 Transmit interrupt vector (NPSWx)
