(1)     2C6 :
(1)     2C6 :                    *** Signed Multiply: multiplicand * multiplier = product
(1)     2C6 :                    *** A negative multiplier is negated with the multiplicand, so the loop
(1)     2C6 :                    *** runs on |multiplier|.
(1)     2C6 :                    *** @param R1 multiplicand
