(1)     2CE :                    *** Unsigned Multiply: multiplicand * multiplier = product
(1)     2CE :                    *** @param R1 multiplicand
(1)     2CE :                    *** @param R2 multiplier
(1)     2CE :                    *** @return R1 product
(1)     2CE :                    *** @clobber R0 R2
